{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Matrix Pro</strong> is a minimalist, single-player logic puzzle about <strong>pattern recall</strong>.<br>Each round shows a short pattern on a grid; when it disappears, reconstruct it as fast and as accurately as you can. Rounds are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, so you always get something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player memory/pattern puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation</strong> \u2014 fresh layouts every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable difficulty</strong> \u2014 from relaxed practice to fast, challenging grids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score/Time chase</strong> \u2014 play for better accuracy and faster clears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong> included for first-time players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works offline (airplane mode)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No ads and no data collection</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, readable UI for keyboard &amp; mouse</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067310?t=1763090349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067310/c3c55b36f0ae3a7289aac93abb57f9952a3793e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763090349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067310/b0d267a852492327bc446797af9526fa59dace6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763090349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067310/b0d267a852492327bc446797af9526fa59dace6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763090349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"descri